<title>USA: Ivex Packaging buys Canadian plastics firm.</title>
<headline>Ivex Packaging buys Canadian plastics firm.</headline>
<dateline>LINCOLNSHIRE, Ill. 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ivex Packaging Corp said Friday it acquired the assets of M&amp;R Plastics Inc, a leading extruder of oriented polystyrene in Canada.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Ivex said the addition of M&amp;R's operations in Quebec and Ontario expands the position of its Kama Corp subsidiary in the North American oriented plastics market.</p>
<p>M&amp;R is the fifth acquisition completed by Ivex in the last 17 months, the company said.</p>
<p>Ivex is a specialty packaging manufacturing company.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
